+
+### Session renew on server -13
+
+When a still-desired connected session receives an authenticated service
+rejection (`-13`), Core attempts one `renew_session` before installing a local
+logout fence. A renewed authorization is installed under the same session fence
+and push reconnects with `session_renewed`. Unchanged credentials, renew
+transport failures, local logout, and desired!=connected keep the original
+logout path. Explicit logout never renews.
